      "El nostre objectiu és simple: que tant tu com el comprador tingueu tot el necessari, ben coordinat i sense haver de buscar res pel vostre compte.": "Our goal is simple: that both you and the buyer have everything you need, well coordinated and without having to look for anything on your own.",
