      "Tenir un inquilí dins no impedeix vendre, però canvia les regles del joc: el dret de tanteig i retracte, el contracte vigent i el perfil de comprador que t'interessa. T'ho expliquem sense embuts.": "Having a tenant in place doesn't stop you selling, but it changes the rules of the game: the right of first refusal, the existing lease, and the buyer profile you should target. We explain it plainly.",
